			"Message": "chore(Land): Advance Dependency and Element submodule pointers\n\nAdvance the Dependency submodule (e481e786 → 47a63f93) and Element submodule (d223e6fd → 0f281e45) to integrate upstream improvements across the dependency tree and editor component layer.\n\nDependency (Deps/Editor): Incorporates Microsoft VS Code Editor dependency advances including a grid-based sessions UI for the Cocoon extension host, SSH encrypted private key passphrase support for Mountain-to-Cocoon remote agent host connectivity, worktree timeout hardening (30s → 60s), and remote session resilience fixes.\n\nElement: Integrates a refactor of Output's InjectTauriDragRegion from a runtime WKWebView stylesheet walker to a build-time CSS source scanner, Wind daily codegen regeneration (CommandCatalog 551→550, ServiceCatalog 500→502), Cocoon Target artifact rebuild, and Mountain CI dependency bump (ad-m/github-push-action 1.1.0 → 1.3.0).\n\nNo source changes in the Land application root — pure submodule pointer updates.",
			"SHA": "7dd94c1c2368fba2d9a05944902ecc27a26dab85"
		},
